{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02518","headline":"送刘散员赋得陈思王诗明月照高楼 · 杨濬","name":"送刘散员赋得陈思王诗明月照高楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼一何绮，素月复流明。\n重轩望不极，余晖揽讵盈。\n镜华当牖照，钩影隔帘生。\n逆愁异尊酒，对此难爲情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨濬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}